WEBVTT

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.910
<i>So many people breathing...</i>

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:21.660
<i>We've only just started down this road, 
but it leads to the distant finish line.</i>

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>Calm down, calm down...</i>

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.460
<i>I'll probably never get 
used to this excitement.</i>

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:32.150
<i>Everyone here is riding for the finish line.</i>

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.930
<i>My second Inter-High has begun.</i>

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.370
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.230
You can do it!

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.360
<i>I can feel the pressure emanating from them.</i>

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:17.090
<i>RIDE.18  The Swelling Aoyagi</i>

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:21.210
Calm down. We're still in the parade section.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.600
Sohoku!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:22.580
What?

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.310
Don't you remember last year?

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:24.490
Onoda!

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.330
The first two kilometers 
of the race are a parade.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.090
Imaizumi!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.330
It's a chance to respond 
to the cheers of the crowd.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.330
Naruko!

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.330
We're last year's champions.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.590
R-Right.

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.460
Look at him. He's really getting into it.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.260
Thank you, thank you! Thank you, thank you!

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.180
That's right! I'm Naruko Shoukichi,
 the Red Bullet!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.470
I'm going to be flashy again this year!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.530
Naruko-kun is amazing.

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.530
He's overdoing it.

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.850
No, wait. Hakone Academy High School
might've been just as...

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:54.650
No, they weren't.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.610
<i>No, wait. Maybe him...</i>

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.370
<i>Does everyone who wears 
tag #3 act like that?</i>

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.950
The pressure's different when there are this 
many people in the crowd. Right, Aoyagi?

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.210
The Inter-High is on its own level.

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:15.610
This is our last chance to relax.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.140
Let me say this while I still 
have the chance, Hajime.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.180
We finally made it.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.680
We're on this side of the fence.

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.410
It took three years from that day.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:33.000
We couldn't bring Tadokoro-san with us.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.930
It's our first and last Inter-High.

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:38.900
I'm counting on you, Hajime.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.500
Yeah, Junta.

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:44.620
I'm trembling.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.330
Don't worry. I'll stop it for you.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.660
I'm relieved.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.190
Hakone Academy High School.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.990
The repeat champions possess 
a different kind of intensity.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.750
They seem so composed despite the tension.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.380
They're like predators closing in on prey.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.350
Prey? You mean Sohoku High School?

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.970
No, you idiot.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:03.840
Then who?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.340
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.550
Hakone Academy High School's 
prey is all of us!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.950
The first result and green tag for 
the fastest sprinter on the flats.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:17.550
The glorious red tag for the 
best climber in the mountains.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.030
The champion's yellow tag.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.290
They'll be going for all of them.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.190
They have the right members to do it.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.780
Excuse me. Excuse me.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.130
Coming through.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.090
What's going on? Someone's coming back.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.320
Excuse me. Sorry.

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:31.200
Is that Sohoku High School?

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.200
Excuse me. Coming through.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:33.330
And he's wearing tag #1!

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.170
Manami-kun!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.250
I finally found you.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.140
Sakamichi-kun...

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.110
Onoda...

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.160
<i>This guy is...</i>

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:44.910
<i>...Onoda Sakamichi.</i>

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.650
<i>Wow, tag #1!</i>

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:51.930
I tried to go see you before the 
race started, but I was too busy.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.390
I, um...

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.810
I'm a second-year now.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.690
I know. So am I.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.360
It's been a while.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:06.490
Yeah. I didn't get to see you guys in Akiba.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.450
I got your water bottle, though.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.280
That's great.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.070
We haven't ridden together since that day.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.670
<b>Closed For Winter</b>

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.250
What's wrong? You both seem down.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.840
We're in the mountains. We're climbing.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.650
But it's winter.

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.930
It's cold, Toudou-san.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.460
That's all right. You'll warm up 
once you start riding.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:39.900
Um, where's the party you 
mentioned in your letter?

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:39.900
<b>Feb. 21

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:42.230
This is it!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:46.090
Unfortunately, the snow will limit your 
vision a bit, but it shouldn't be a problem.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.890
It's definitely a problem.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:48.540
Nope.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.850
H-How far are we climbing?

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.920
To the top, of course.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.880
Just the two of us?

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.580
What about you, Toudou-san?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.340
I'd never ride in this freezing cold snow.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:01.790
What?

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:05.760
Ride. If you don't ride, it's meaningless.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:06.760
What?

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.650
I'll be graduating soon.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:10.590
Before I do,

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:17.140
I need to pass on the titles 
"King of the Mountain" and "Mountain God."

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:21.860
It has to be one of you.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.390
This road sucks.

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:30.410
The patches of snow 
are making my tires slip.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.520
Yeah. The falling snow's bad, too.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.580
I can't see.

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:35.490
But it's kind of...

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.450
Yeah.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.210
It's fun.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.030
Yeah.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.960
How did it go? Who won?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.840
Manami, Four-Eyes...

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.630
We couldn't do it.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:52.890
Partway up the mountain there was too 
much snow. We couldn't keep riding.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:55.570
I see. That's unfortunate.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.200
It can't be helped, then.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.650
We'll have to postpone this race 
until the summer's Inter-High.

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:03.770
Yeah.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.400
I guess so.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.810
Don't be late this year, Manami.

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.640
I can't guarantee that.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.270
Oh, right. Give Four-Eyes your number.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.940
Have him call you the day of the race.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:16.430
Your number? Okay.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.520
Sakamichi-kun...

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.880
Do you still like climbs?

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:26.880
Yeah.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.340
Then let's race.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.310
It's decided.

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.220
Yeah.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.800
On that mountain...

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:40.390
Let's squeeze every bit of strength 
and fight to the end!

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:44.340
Yeah.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.140
Well, I'd better get going.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.750
Should you have made that promise?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:58.790
Izumida-san told me to beat him 
once we enter the mountains.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:05.520
You're only able to say that because you've 
never ridden against Sakamichi-kun before.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.140
Don't worry.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:11.150
Where and when don't matter.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.360
We only agreed to ride together.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:19.060
It's a small promise, but he 
always keeps his promises.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.060
They'll be coming soon.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:28.440
Once they wave that flag, 
the parade run will be over.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.470
The race will start.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:31.270
Okay.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.080
<i>The battle is starting!</i>

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.960
Move aside, small fries!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.890
The sprinter's pride and first result

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:49.000
belongs to Ohori from
Fukuoka Jousei High School!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.090
Go, Doubashi.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:54.340
It's Hakone Academy High School's Doubashi.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.220
He's huge.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.840
He makes Izumida look small.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:03.060
He's Hakone Academy High School's undefeated 
sprinter who tears up the road,

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.190
Road Monster Doubashi!

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.520
This race is starting to heat up.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.620
This is the Inter-High.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:12.900
As captain of Hakone Academy High School,

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.620
I know I should keep my personal 
feelings out of the race.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.160
But...

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:22.950
<i>My right pec Andy and my 
left pec Frank are excited.</i>

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.350
<i>They're overjoyed.</i>

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:29.880
First, Doubashi, push aside the other 
teams and take the first result.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.340
And...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.300
Whatever you do, don't lose 
to Sohoku High School!

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:41.510
Simple. That's an easy order, Izumida-san.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.660
<i>My heart is leaping with joy.</i>

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.990
<i>This is why I love the Inter-High.</i>

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:48.690
Go, Doubashi!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.530
They released a rampaging beast 
on the Inter-High course!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:58.200
Move! Move, or I'll crush you!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.500
Doubashi?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.760
Come on! Go faster!

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.630
If you ride that slowly,
even the ants will catch up to you!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.830
Aoyagi, Kaburagi.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:12.550
Yes, sir.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:13.840
Go.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.460
Sohoku High School's making their move, too.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.180
It's third-year sprinter Aoyagi Hajime.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.760
And first-year Kaburagi, #6!

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:23.890
Sohoku High School's sending 
two guys this year, too.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.830
Begin the pursuit.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:29.270
Chase down the sprinters in front of us
and Hakone Academy High School!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.110
Wait, Teshima-san.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:37.720
We should have Naruko-san go here 
and save me for the finish line.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:41.320
After all, I'm an all-rounder.

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.460
Huh? What?

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.210
Who will race for the finish line if not me?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.270
Quit complaining. It's an order.

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:54.800
Ow, ow! Let go!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:59.990
Let go! Teshima-san, take 
back your mistake, and...

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.970
Let's go.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:05.180
You haven't told Kaburagi-kun what Koga-san 
said about his legs at the training camp?

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:06.600
Nope.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:10.330
I'm counting on you, Aoyagi.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.280
Hurry, Sugimoto.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.360
Yes, sir.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.740
There's always a rush right after the start.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:23.280
Yeah, it's hard work.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.410
Why do you look so happy?

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.790
Sawada, Gorizou, Sadatoki...

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.570
Follow us in the bus.

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.250
Yes, sir.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.940
Is it really okay for us to ride in the van?

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.210
Of course.

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:41.450
There's a lot to do in the feed zones 
that require a woman's touch.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.360
I don't really have that.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:44.970
Well, I'll do my best.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:47.140
Kanzaki-san, we're counting on you.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.720
Leave it to me.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.810
Sugimoto-san...

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.030
Danchiku.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:55.810
Please take care of Issa—of Kaburagi Issa.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:59.880
Cheer him on at the feed zone for me.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:00.740
Got it.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:05.740
I want him to ride with no regrets 
in the race of his dreams.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:10.200
Issa and I always rode together 
during middle school.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.120
Kaburagi's got a good friend in you.

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.530
Danchiku, get in.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.210
What?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.670
Sugimoto, could you pack our gear in 
tighter and get out the spare seat?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.590
I'll try.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.840
But I...

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:29.260
You should tell him your pure wish yourself.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.480
You'll give him strength as he rides.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:34.230
Yes, sir.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.250
Okay, let's go.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.490
Why am I being made to participate 
in a sprinter's race?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.070
Did Teshima-san make a mistake?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:48.980
I told him I'm an all-rounder 
a bunch of times.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.190
Maybe he thought I said "all-binder."

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:53.460
A binder closes, the way I'm a closer of races.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.550
It's Sohoku High School.

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.070
They caught up.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:13:01.380
Two? Sohoku High School sent 
two sprinters again this year?

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:02.590
What?

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.220
I'm not a sprinter!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:05.720
You got that?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:08.300
Hey, I'm a second-year!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.700
I don't care! I'm Sohoku 
High School's secret ace!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.850
I'm the all-rounder, Kaburagi Issa!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.280
You should care.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:16.710
Sorry.

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:19.190
Oh, no. It's fine.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:21.180
Question, Kaburagi.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.640
This pack isn't the lead pack yet.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.750
Forty-three sprinters jumped
ahead at the signal.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:30.430
You were counting?

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:33.870
We've passed thirteen so far. So...

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.210
There's twenty left!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.800
Thirty.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:37.520
Huh?

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:43.610
Excluding the eight guys here, 
there are twenty-two in front of us.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.800
Among them is one of
Hakone Academy High School's riders.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.180
I see.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:52.640
The first day of the course runs 
north along National Route 119.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.100
<b>Touhoku
 Roadway</b>

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.990
We'll pass through wide two-lane city 
streets in practically a straight line.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:58.600
<b>Kinugawa
River</b>

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:58.600
<b>Touhoku
Bullet
Train</b>

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.600
<b>Nikkou
Road</b>

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.460
That'll turn into a one-lane 
road passing under the highway.

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:05.320
Just past where the road starts to be lined 
with pine trees is a three-way intersection.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.240
That's the first result line.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.110
The green number tag line.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:10.910
Really?

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.240
The road just before the line 
is lined with pine trees.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:16.130
We'll be mostly unaffected by the wind.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:21.290
If we don't pass those twenty-two sprinters,
they'll take first place away from us.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:22.960
I see.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.340
<i>His eyes changed.</i>

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.840
Pull. It's your turn next.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.150
Damn. Sohoku High School's moving.

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.090
Stop them.

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:32.800
You can't stop us!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.210
They're fast.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:35.720
There's a ninety-degree turn ahead.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.310
I'll push my way into it.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.870
I'm Kochi Tosaumi High School's
sprinter, Shimizu.

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.150
They call me the Corner Magician.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:47.300
No one's cornering is sharper than mine!

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:51.500
You can't be serious!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.790
They're unbelievable.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.450
That switch, that rise...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:01.080
He's a natural-born sprinter!

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.180
<i>What? That's odd.</i>

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.880
<i>Why can't anyone keep up with me
when I'm just an all-rounder?</i>

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.660
I don't know if this is the second or third,

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.490
but we've caught up to 
the pack in front of us.

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.670
You're next, Aoyagi-san.

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:17.750
Got it.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.310
You've arrived, Sohoku High School.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:26.140
I'm the sprinter of the North, Niigata 
Jouetsu Higashi High School's Yaguramaru.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:32.320
Last year you had Tadokoro, but this 
year's Sohoku High School is so small.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.800
H-He's not small!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.170
His body transformed!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.900
You mean torso.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:47.070
Your muscles expand when you use them.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:50.170
Apparently, my difference 
in size is a bit extreme.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:54.000
My torso has currently expanded 
to its maximum size.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.350
In other words, I'm about to...

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.500
Start riding as hard as I can!

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:02.940
Tadokoro-san's Supersonic 
Oxygen Human Bullet!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.020
Huh? They're already out of sight.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:13.880
Wow, we pulled ahead of them in no time.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:17.910
It feels seriously awesome to do 
something like this at the Inter-High.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:22.140
But spare a thought for the 
guy behind you, Aoyagi-san.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.550
After all, I'm not a sprinter.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.960
I almost fell behind.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:30.880
Yaguramaru's a top-class sprinter, too.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:31.970
What?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.800
<i>He kept up.</i>

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:36.970
All out?

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.240
That's right. If you have 
the opportunity, test him.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.480
Sprint as hard as you 
can with him behind you.

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.020
Are you sure you want 100%? 
What if he falls behind?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:50.150
Then you'll have to leave him behind.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:53.280
Unfortunately, if he can't 
keep up, either way...

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.910
He won't stand a chance at the front.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.300
What are you talking about?

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.870
That Yagura-san can't be top-class.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:06.170
<i>He kept up with me at 100% acceleration, 
Junta. On top of that...</i>

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:09.200
Are you sure he's not a climber?

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.460
<i>He's still talking.</i>

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:15.550
<i>In other words, he stands a 
chance at the front of the pack.</i>

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:18.020
I see the pack in front of us.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:20.680
Once we catch up,
it'll be my turn. Let's switch.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.060
Finally.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.850
Let's head to the front, Kaburagi.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.890
What's gotten into you, Aoyagi-san?

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.330
You seem happy.

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.400
Shut up, and follow me!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.430
Yes, sir!

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:34.240
Human Bullet!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:39.490
The sprinters who gave up on the 
first result are falling back.

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:42.590
Is Hakone Academy High School's 
Doubashi in the front?

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:45.080
He went flying ahead at a crazy speed.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:49.070
I heard Fukuoka's Ohori is 
in good shape this year.

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:51.420
Who's the fastest sprinter?

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.800
<i>I really want to go!</i>

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:59.300
<i>My body's saying, "Are you stupid?
Why are you riding so slowly on the flats?"</i>

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.970
<i>I could probably still make it if I left now.</i>

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.680
<i>I could slip past these guys and 
take this year's first result!</i>

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.410
<i>This is the Inter-High.</i>

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.700
<i>They're racing to see who's the fastest.</i>

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.620
<i>When will you go if not now,
Naruko Shoukichi?</i>

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.150
<i>My blood is screaming!</i>

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.650
<i>I can't take it!</i>

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>I'm going.</i>

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:21.200
You're enduring it well, Naruko.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.790
W-Well, yeah. Th-This is nothing.

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.960
<i>That was close.</i>

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.260
As a guy who loves being flashy,

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:34.970
it must've been hard not participating 
in a sprint through the city.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.920
I'm totally fine.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:40.050
Your expression fails to match your words.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:45.520
Whatever the case, I'm grateful you 
switched to being an all-rounder.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.490
I didn't do it for you, idiot.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:52.330
You're not going, Sohoku High School's
Naruko Shoukichi?

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.520
Hakone Academy High School's Lashes!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.980
<i>He's here to spy on us.</i>

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.990
I thought it'd be no fun if I raced,
since it'd be a blowout.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.070
I let my senior and junior go instead.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.730
<i>Is this their plan?</i>

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.980
<i>He doesn't seem unwell.</i>

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:10.710
We sent Doubashi since he's been 
doing well since this spring.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:15.090
You're acting calm, but you're 
actually desperate to go, aren't you?

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:17.510
<i>Frank...</i>

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:19.800
There's no point in hiding it.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.950
That's exactly right, Naruko-kun.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:25.500
Are you sad you don't get 
to hear me shout "abs, abs"?

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:29.490
It's the perfect way to cheer someone up.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:32.400
I wanted to show off my secret weapon, too.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.530
Then shall we race, Naruko-kun?

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.280
Bring it on, Lashes!

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:45.490
All the muscles in my body are screaming!

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.870
My blood's about to boil because of you!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.830
You've reminded me of last year's battle!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:55.420
It's 200 meters to the big flag up ahead.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.720
Let's see who reaches it first!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.090
Very well! Abs!

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.100
It's on!

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.380
Wait, Naruko.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.380
Wait, Touichirou.

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:05.950
Don't waste your energy.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.180
The race has only just started.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.020
Don't jump ahead, Touichirou.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.650
What are you, a grasshopper?

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:19.020
My muscles are delighted to have 
returned to the Inter-High.

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:21.030
I was expressing how they felt.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.490
Are you a pervert?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.280
Is that a compliment, Yuki?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.650
My muscles have gotten stronger.

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:30.740
They've become more flexible.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:33.750
Far more than last year.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:40.210
<i>I could tell through his clothes.</i>

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:44.610
We'll race later, Naruko-kun.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.520
Yeah.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:51.080
By the way, what kind of sprinters did 
Sohoku High School send to the sprint battle?

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:51.890
What?

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:56.440
Our Doubashi is even more abnormal than me.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.480
<i>Abnormal?</i>

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.760
He never slacks off.

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:05.200
He's proud to be a part of 
Hakone Academy High School.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.700
He's blessed with a powerful body, 
and he's as competitive as a beast.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:13.000
It's as they say. He's a monster.

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:17.290
If all you're challenging him with 
is a bit of hard work or talent,

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.970
you won't beat him.

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:23.790
Everyone who has challenged him 
and lost says the same thing.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:28.150
"The moment I caught up to him, 
all the hairs on my body stood up,

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:30.100
and my legs quailed."

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.530
He's even more abnormal than I am.

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:13.130
It's cold. I need a kotatsu.

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:15.650
It's because you're so lightly dressed.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:20.420
Here, put this on. You, too, Four-Eyes.

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:23.420
B-But won't you be cold, Toudou-san?

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.670
Don't worry.

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:28.910
Not only can I climb, 
but I'm also cold-resistant.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:30.210
On top of that, I'm beautiful.

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:33.430
No matter where or when I am, I'm perfect.

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>NEXT RIDE  Road Monster Doubashi</i>

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:44.900
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:51.000
<b><i>The high cadence
 continues!!</i></b>
